{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15204520","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204520","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1520452001:0":{"text":"마법사님, 추적 마법에 몸이 편해지는 효과도 있는 건가요? 마법이라는 건 정말 신기하네요. 정말 아무것도 모르겠어요...","source_cn":"魔法师大人，追踪魔法还有让人身体舒适的功效吗？魔法好神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99B10C689B0120AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520452002:0":{"text":"모르는 게 정상이야. 괜히 캐묻지 마.","source_cn":"搞不明白就对了，别问那么多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3358947D1330D126","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520452003:0":{"text":"가서 밥이나 먹어. 난 좀 쉬어야겠어. 진짜 피곤해 죽겠네...","source_cn":"吃饭去，让我休息一会。今天真是太累了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE12331FC8BA3FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520452004:0":{"text":"저기... 마법사님.","source_cn":"哦……那个，魔法师大人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35012FD4AD05E9A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520452005:0":{"text":"왜 또?","source_cn":"怎么？<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA251DDAAE56C53A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_